## Scope

UI: `src/features/recruiter-assistant/**`. API: `services/recruiter-assistant-api/**`.

Read `docs/plans/recruiter-assistant-plan.md` and `services/recruiter-assistant-api/SETUP.md` for AWS/CI.

## Conventions

- i18n: `RecruiterAssistant` / `RecruiterAssistantTerms` / `RecruiterAssistantProfessionalContext` in all four `src/messages/*.json`; terms body `public/content/recruiter-assistant/terms/<locale>.md`; professional context `public/content/recruiter-assistant/professional-context/<locale>.md`.
- `NEXT_PUBLIC_RECRUITER_API_URL` at Next build time; dev default `http://127.0.0.1:3001`.
- MUI + `sx` (see `components.mdc`).
- Pipeline: see `runRecruiterAssistantPipeline.ts` (orchestrates topic agents under `agents/*/*Agent.ts`). RAG: `contextAgent.createContext` → `src/retrieval/` (`RECRUITER_RETRIEVER_PROVIDER`: `custom` | `llamaindex-hydrated` | `llamaindex-native` | `compare`). Agent instructions in `agents/**/instructions.md` (`getAgentInstruction.ts`). When pipeline behavior changes, sync `public/content/experience/danieltostes-com/<locale>.md` (all four locales) per recruiter-assistant skill step 4. Tune caps in `constants.ts`.
- Deps: root `ai` + `@ai-sdk/react`; service `ai` + `@ai-sdk/openai` — follow `dependencies.mdc` per package.

## Security

No logging API keys, full prompts, or interests pack contents. Align `ALLOWED_ORIGIN` with CORS.
